---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Ali Alhejab is a Lead AI Engineer at HUMAIN in Riyadh, building agentic AI, real-time avatars, and generative image and video systems."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell page-header-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="page-kicker eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">AI engineer, from research to production systems.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="page-lede">
        I lead AI engineering work at HUMAIN, building real-time avatar agents, generative media
        systems, and the infrastructure that makes them usable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="about-shell">
    <div class="shell about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="about-intro">
          I'm <strong>Ali Alhejab</strong>, a Lead AI Engineer at HUMAIN in {SITE.location}. I work
          across agentic AI, LLMs, image and video generation, deep learning, and computer vision.
        </p>

        <div class="about-copy">
          <p>
            At HUMAIN, I built an in-house avatar platform that reduced costs by 92% versus
            third-party solutions. I develop real-time AI avatar agents for virtual presenting and
            meeting facilitation, with conversational pipelines that connect STT, LLM, and TTS. I
            also pretrain and fine-tune video diffusion models for custom avatars and optimize
            inference for CPU and GPU deployments.
          </p>

          <h2>Background</h2>
          <p>
            Before HUMAIN, I was an AI Engineer at SDAIA, working across computer vision, NLP, and
            generative modeling. That included DETR and YOLO detection for construction-site
            surveillance, a sign-language-to-text system using T5 and AV-HuBERT, LoRA fine-tuning
            for Flux, Hunyuan, and Wan 2.1, and multi-GPU training with Hugging Face Accelerate and
            DeepSpeed. I also optimized vision and LLM inference with TensorRT, vLLM, and TeaCache.
          </p>

          <p>
            My path into AI started in electrical engineering. I completed an MSc at KAUST in
            Electrical and Computer Engineering, specializing in solar energy systems, where I
            developed a single-voltage-sensor method for photovoltaic fault localization and worked
            with NEOM on solar-glass testing. I also hold a BSc in Electrical Engineering from KFUPM,
            with a specialization in IoT.
          </p>

          <h2>Research and writing</h2>
          <p>
            My work has been published with IEEE and Springer, spanning sign-language translation,
            photovoltaic fault localization, energy-efficient aerial IoT systems, and
            switched-capacitor converter design. I write here about the engineering side of AI:
            benchmarks, inference trade-offs, training pipelines, and the details that decide whether
            a system works outside a notebook.
          </p>

          <h2>How I work</h2>
          <p>
            I prefer small, testable steps over large unverified jumps. In practice that means
            reproducible experiments, clear baselines, and a healthy suspicion of a single benchmark.
            If a technique cannot be measured, it is hard to defend.
          </p>

          <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
          <p>
            You can find me on <a class="text-link" href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>,{' '}
            <a class="text-link" href={SITE.x}>X</a>, and{' '}
            <a class="text-link" href={SITE.scholar}>Google Scholar</a>, or reach me by{' '}
            <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>email</a>. The full CV is{' '}
            <a class="text-link" href="/cv/">here</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-side" aria-label="Background at a glance">
        <p class="about-side-head">At a glance</p>
        <dl class="about-facts">
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>Lead AI Engineer, HUMAIN</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Experience</dt>
            <dd>Industry and research · HUMAIN, SDAIA, KAUST, Saudi Aramco</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Education</dt>
            <dd>MSc, KAUST · BSc, KFUPM</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Certification</dt>
            <dd>NVIDIA Certified Associate — Generative AI</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Research</dt>
            <dd>IEEE and Springer publications</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Focus</dt>
            <dd>Agentic AI · LLMs · image & video generation · computer vision</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-fact">
            <dt>Location</dt>
            <dd>{SITE.location}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="about-side-foot">
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="/cv/">View CV <Icon name="arrow-right" size={15} /></a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
